save('FRONTEND_INVENTORY.md','# Current frontend inventory\n\nResolved lock versions: '+Object.entries(inv.versions).map(([k,v])=>`${k} ${v}`).join(', ')+'. Package ranges differ from resolved versions; local lock/source is authoritative.\n\n'+Object.entries(inv.architecture).map(([k,v])=>`- **${k}**: ${v}.`).join('\n')+'\n\n'+components.length+' component JSX files, '+inv.componentExports.length+' exported reusable components/functions in components/; total25 shared React components when including AreaLayout, two route guards and AuthProvider (page-local components/hooks/composition roots excluded). '+inv.pageFiles.length+' page JSX files / 20 route screens. No .gitkeep counted as a screen/component.\n\n| Component file | Exported UI | Lines |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n'+components.map(c=>`| [${path.basename(c.file)}](../../${c.file}) | ${c.exports.join(', ')} | ${c.lines} |`).join('\n')+'\n\nPages: '+inv.pageFiles.map(p=>`[${path.basename(p.file)}](../../${p.file})`).join(', ')+'. Full files/assets/form/layout/state inventory: [JSON](FRONTEND_INVENTORY.json), [screens](SCREEN_INVENTORY.md), [form audit](FORM_AUDIT.md). Tables: generic Admin and cinema-image tables; other flows largely lists/cards/dl. Dialogs: native confirm; no custom modal focus trap to audit. No icon library; favicon.svg is a local asset. Gallery/poster media come from existing data; screenshots are unmodified application rendering.\n');
save('DESIGN_SYSTEM_AUDIT.md','# Existing design language — preserve identity\n\nNavy/blue primary #273e82; hero gradient #182b62→#3f63ad; page #f5f6fa, white surfaces; dark text #171923; muted #667085; borders #dfe3eb/#cbd1dc; success #17653a; danger #a42b2b/#8d2525; warning-like health border #e9bd9b (no shared warning token). Eyebrow #8ca6e5. No palette replacement proposed.\n\nTypography: Inter/system-ui/sans-serif declared, body16px/default normal line-height; no bundled font/@font-face guarantee of Inter. Hero heading clamp2–3.4rem, detail2–3.2rem, movie-card title1.1rem, table.92rem, eyebrow.75rem/800. Native input appearance differs outside auth/catalog-filters. Normal body line-height and mixed English/Vietnamese labels are polish opportunities.\n\nSpacing: page/main1rem; catalog max76rem; auth max34rem/padding1.5rem; booking max52rem/padding2rem; sections2rem; cards1–1.15rem; auth grid gap1rem; gallery/grid gaps1rem; chips/actions.5–.7rem. Forms outside auth use class catalog-form without a rule (UIUX-001).\n\nShape: border1px; radius.35–1rem; cards.8rem; flat surfaces, no authored box-shadow/elevation system. Hero is visual focus; not all operations need decorative cards.\n\nComponents: catalog-button primary/secondary, movie/cinema/showtime/actor/review cards, auth controls, status/empty/error states, horizontally scrollable table. Admin tab buttons all same primary base with aria-pressed outline; many Manager/Payment/Booking actions use native controls. No authored Button/Input/Badge/Modal abstraction, no animation system, no icon-only button family.\n\nTokens: zero CSS custom properties; all colors/radii/gaps are literal, though class reuse already gives a useful base. Missing class rules and shared controls are higher priority than a new framework. [Measured style analysis](evidence/style-analysis.json). UIUX-004 contrast affects specific text use on light surfaces, not identity itself; future adjustment can reuse dark colors already in the palette.\n');
